@CartService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5232
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@itemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Get cart
GET {{CartService_HostAddress}}/api/cart?userId={{userId}}

### Add item to cart
POST {{CartService_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemId": "{{itemId}}",
  "quantity": 1,
  "userId": "{{userId}}"
}

### Remove item from cart (decrements quantity, or removes if quantity is 1)
DELETE {{CartService_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/{{itemId}}?userId={{userId}}

###
